        "kind": "constant",
        "value": {
          "does_not_prove": [
            "visual layout fidelity in Hancom (line/page breaks, overlap) — needs the visual oracle / ComputerUse",
            "every authored element round-tripped byte-for-byte: merges, shapes, BinData bytes, and equation script are not value-diffed",
